OL,3,AIndia's opposition leader dragged onto
OL,4,Abus as police break up protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelhi witnessed dramatic scenes on
OL,7,FTuesday night when police broke up a
OL,8,Fprotest by opposition leader Rahul
OL,9,FGandhi and other MPs who were seeking
OL,10,Fthe resignation of India's top election
OL,11,Fofficial over a controversial voter
OL,12,Froll revision.
OL,14,FVideos showing police forcing Gandhi
OL,15,Fonto a bus and preventing him from
OL,16,Fclimbing out of the bus window
OL,17,Fsubsequently went viral on social
OL,18,Fmedia.
OL,20,FThe protest marks a fresh escalation in
OL,21,Fthe opposition's standoff with the
OL,22,FElection Commission.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
